{"id":"wb-6-655","name":"陈元光祖祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈元光祖祠","text":"陈元光祖祠，又称陈氏将军祠，是为纪念“开漳圣王”陈元光而建的祠堂，位于中国河南省固始县陈集镇。由陈元光之孙陈钸始建于唐朝天宝年间，现存建筑为清朝嘉庆年间所建，共计31间。是国务院公布的第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E5%85%83%E5%85%89%E7%A5%96%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":88058195,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88058195","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f17cf98a4d5ca3624fc53864.jpg","title":"Chenyuanguang_family_temple-Gushi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chenyuanguang_family_temple-Gushi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/Chenyuanguang_family_temple-Gushi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sinopitt","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于河南省固始县的陈元光祖祠","width":320,"height":240}}